<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clan Commands</h1>
<p>The clan commands are split up into groups: some only for the clan Master, some 
for the Master and the clan lords (the second in charge of the clan), some for 
all members (a few of them only for members appointed to an office of the 
clan), and one that anyone can use, even when not in a clan. Each has its own 
help page.
</p><p><b>Clan Master:</b>
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>help cappoint</a>   appoint a lord, treasurer, quartermaster or new Master
<a cmd='#'>help cdepose</a>    take a member out of a position (also rank 25)
<a cmd='#'>help cstart</a>     take up a newly approved clan, once
</pre>
<p><b>Clan Master and lords:</b>
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>help caccept</a>    take in a new member
<a cmd='#'>help cremove</a>    remove a member
<a cmd='#'>help cpromote</a>   set a member's rank (also rank 16 and up)
<a cmd='#'>help csrank</a>     the titles of the clan's ranks
<a cmd='#'>help ctitle</a>     a member's title
</pre>
<p><b>Members:</b>
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>help cinfo</a>  <a cmd='#'>help cdeposit</a>  <a cmd='#'>help cbalance</a>  <a cmd='#'>help cstore</a>  <a cmd='#'>help cequipment</a>
<a cmd='#'>help crank</a>  <a cmd='#'>help cdefect</a>  <a cmd='#'>help center</a>  <a cmd='#'>help cexit</a>  <a cmd='#'>help clan donate</a>
</pre>
<p><b>Appointed members</b> (treasurer, quartermaster):
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>help cwithdraw</a>  <a cmd='#'>help cunstore</a>
</pre>
<p><b>Anyone:</b>
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>help clist</a>
</pre>
<p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Startup</a>
</pre>




</div>